From d2ca429c18514f50eec0d74a9e8cbd1ee6a605cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <dev@infoverify.local>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:59:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Demographic Verification page + WhatsApp floating icon

- New /demo page: NIN_Phone-style layout with 5 slip-type tiles (using
  the sample images in public/branding) + a name/gender/DOB form,
  wired to POST /verification/nin/by-demographic.
  Note: Techhub's nin_by_demo.php has no tier parameter and the backend
  only prices one flat NIN_DEMOGRAPHIC service, so the 5 tiles are a
  cosmetic pick (same price/result either way) rather than real tiers -
  matches the reference design per user's choice.
  Also skips the reference's 'Single/Multiple Results' toggle since
  there's no multi-result mode on the backend.
- New WhatsappFloat component: fixed circular WhatsApp button linking
  to CONTACT.whatsappGroupUrl, bottom-left (so it doesn't collide with
  the MARIA AI Assistant FAB which defaults bottom-right). Mounted in
  AppShell (all authenticated pages) and on the public LandingPage.
